PortSystem          1.0
PortGroup           R 1.0

R.setup             github scrapertweeter3-prog flatratemath-r 0.1.0 v
revision            0
name                R-flatratemath
categories-append   devel math
maintainers         nomaintainer
license             MIT
description         Benchmark math for flat-rate software subscriptions
long_description    Two constants and two functions that benchmark a\
                    flat-rate unlimited software development subscription\
                    against the fully loaded monthly cost of a senior US\
                    software engineer. annual_saving() returns the yearly\
                    dollar gap between the two rates and coverage_multiple()\
                    returns how many months of subscription work a single\
                    month of hiring budget covers. Pure arithmetic, no\
                    dependencies, suitable for pricing pages and\
                    procurement math.
homepage            https://poketdev.com

